<title>CHINA: RESULTS OF THIRD ROUND OF CHINA SOCCER LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>RESULTS OF THIRD ROUND OF CHINA SOCCER LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of third round of</p>
<p>China's professional soccer league played on Thursday:</p>
