<p> Dalian Wanda	 2    Tianjin Lifei	0</p>
<p> Qingdao Hainiu     2    Vanguards Huandao  0</p>
<p> Shanghai Shenhua   4    Guangdong Hongyuan 1</p>
<p> August First	 0    Guangzhou Apollo   0</p>
<p> Sichuan Quanxing   3    Yanbian Aodong     1</p>
